{"id":14571,"author":"Scorpioon","body":"\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cb\u003eKITAS GRAPHIC's FOR FREE! :D\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eHelp Kitatist to make his dream true to become \u0026nbsp;an IRL graphic designer!\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eAlso, please read the entire post!*\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003ci\u003eNote: Scoll Down To See An Amazing Portafolio\u0026nbsp;\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eHi! Welcome to my graphic petition post!\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eI made over 1000 banners, renders and any graphics in this past summer (2014), but i carry on!\u003c/div\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eRemember all is\u003cb\u003e free\u003c/b\u003e AND \u003cb\u003ecustom\u003c/b\u003e!\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eTo sumbit something only describe me your request and in a short periode of time you will have your image ready!\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eHow to apply\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eFirstly:\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e- Text\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e- Background\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e- Colour theme\u0026nbsp;\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e- Style or Font\u0026nbsp;\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eI need you to apply \"cleanly and easy to undrestand\", if not I might dont understand what u want and u will get skiped!\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eAlso a requisit is please subscribe to my youtube channel, \u003ca href=\"http://www.youtube.com/user/kitatist\" title=\"Link: http://www.youtube.com/user/kitatist\"\u003ewww.youtube.com/user/kitatist\u003c/a\u003e , then on the purchase tell me ur YT ign so I can check if u suscribed!\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eHow do I work?\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eEasy! You made you request wich I add down the OP, if I finish the first's purchases I get the next, then your request gots the status of WIP, wich means that im designing it on a sheet of paper (I do this every time, cuz im really good ad drawing :P). Then I prepare the most elements I will need to start the speedart, I open camptasiarecorder and I press start!\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eIf you request is relly interesting I may made a short video called \"speed art\", where you can see how the graphic was made, uploaded to my YT Channel.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eAlso remeber, please subscribe to it for more stuff like this, it helps me alot!\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eI\u003ci\u003eMPORTANT: I need you to give me credit about the img...! Its important for me, because seeing people with ur stuff raving arround inspires into doing more! :D\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cu\u003eYou can ask me ANYTHING any type of banner render etc..\u003c/u\u003e.\u003c/div\u003e\u0